OL,3,GNEWSAMother writes book to help
OL,4,Achildren with cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother who wrote a book to help her
OL,7,Ftoddler cope with losing her hair
OL,8,Fduring cancer treatment is hoping that
OL,9,Fcopies can be distributed to hospitals
OL,10,Fto help other children going through
OL,11,Fthe same thing.
OL,13,FHolly, who used to live in Bristol but
OL,14,Frelocated to London, wrote Edie's Magic
OL,15,FHair about a young girl who has to
OL,16,Fregrow her hair in a last step to
OL,17,Fbecome a superhero.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
