OL,3,GNEWSAMother writes book to help
OL,4,Achildren with cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe titular character was inspired by
OL,7,Fher four-year-old daughter Edie, who
OL,8,Fwas diagnosed with a rare form of bone
OL,9,Fcancer last year. She is now in
OL,10,Fremission.
OL,12,FHolly says that because the book worked
OL,13,Ffor her daughter, it could "have that
OL,14,Fsame positive impact for children in
OL,15,Fand around her age going through
OL,16,Fexactly the same thing".
